      "details": "<p><span>The representative location of Tuba is based on\u00a0</span><a href=\"http://www.worldcat.org/oclc/803804468\">George 1992</a><span>: 24 fig. 4. Due to the shifting course of the Arahtu River (modern \u0160a\u1e6d\u1e6d al-\u1e24illah), much of this western district of Babylon is now on the east side of the river; in antiquity it would have been on the western bank.</span></p>",
